    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\n ![](https://huggingface.co/avatars/d6b91f6738559209972fe9561e1915a6.svg) ⟨28⟩\nSebssihakim⟨28⟩\n/\nClean_One_Speaker_SADA_Split⟨29⟩\nlike 0\nTasks:  Automatic Speech Recognition ⟨30⟩ Audio Classification ⟨31⟩\nModalities:  Audio ⟨32⟩ Text ⟨33⟩\nFormats:  parquet ⟨34⟩\noptimized-parquet\nLanguages:  Arabic ⟨35⟩\nSize:  10K - 100K ⟨36⟩\nLibraries:  Datasets ⟨37⟩ Dask ⟨38⟩ Polars ⟨39⟩ + 1\nLicense:\ncc-by-nc-sa-4.0\n Dataset card ⟨29⟩ Data Studio ⟨40⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨41⟩ Community ⟨42⟩\n##  You need to agree to share your contact information to access this dataset\nThis repository is publicly accessible, but you have to accept the conditions to access its files and content.\nLog in⟨43⟩ or Sign Up⟨44⟩ to review the conditions and access this dataset content.\n  * Splits⟨45⟩\n  * Columns⟨46⟩\n  * License & attribution⟨47⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨48⟩ Clean_One_Speaker_SADA_Split \nTrain/validation/test version of Sebssihakim/Clean_One_Speaker_SADA⟨49⟩, a cleaned single-speaker subset of the SADA corpus (SDAIA / Saudi Broadcasting Authority).\n##   ⟨45⟩ Splits \n80/10/10, stratified by `speaker_dialect`, seed 42: train ~30.8k, validation ~3.9k, test ~3.9k rows.\n  * The `Maghrebi` dialect (7 rows) was removed — too few samples to stratify.\n  * Splits are segment-level: the same source show/speaker may appear in more than one split.\n  * Rare dialects (Yemeni, Shamali, Janubi) have very few validation/test samples; per-dialect metrics on them are not statistically meaningful.\n\n\n##   ⟨46⟩ Columns \n`audio`, `text`, `cleaned_text`, `speaker_age`, `speaker_gender`, `speaker_dialect`\n##   ⟨47⟩ License & attribution \nDerived from **SADA** (SDAIA & Saudi Broadcasting Authority), CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. This derivative keeps the same license (non-commercial, share-alike).\nCopy to bucket new \n\nDownloads last month\n    21\nTotal file size: 5.46 GB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨50⟩ Privacy⟨51⟩ About⟨52⟩ Careers⟨53⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
